WEBVTT

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.770
DigiXros!

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.210
DigiXros!

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:05.990
DigiXros!

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.580
Man, what a weird dream.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.640
Maybe I'm too tired...

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:02.260
I can't get tired already!

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.300
Today's the big day, after all!

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:26.580
<b>Taiki</b>

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:26.920
<b>Taiki Goes to</b>

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:27.450
<b>Taiki Goes to Another</b>

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:34.330
<b>Taiki Goes to Another World!</b>

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:31.350
Taiki Goes to Another World!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:37.030
<b>Koto Ward, Shinonome</b>

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.830
Hello, this is Akari.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.240
Is Taiki awake?

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.020
What? He got ready and 
took off somewhere?

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:44.270
Did he have a volleyball?

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:49.070
No, the ball he was carrying 
looked a little bigger.

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:52.130
A basketball?! When did he...

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:54.380
I'll ask at the school, Mrs. Kudou.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:03.620
Darn it, Taiki! You've started 
with that bad habit again!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.160
This is not gonna be 
good for Marine Day!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:15.070
Wow, cool!

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.590
All right!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.340
I'll make this my wallpaper.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.190
Wait! Taiki!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:33.380
Taiki!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.090
Here we go!

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.790
Super Miracle...

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:43.900
...Shot!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.800
Psyche! Pass!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.000
All right!

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.020
Akari?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.550
Shinonome East Middle 
School wins 33 to 32.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.290
Bow!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.060
Thank you for the game!

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.520
Thanks, Taiki!

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.860
Now we can go on to the second round!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.820
The old bait and switch 
worked like a charm.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.290
I guess I did pretty 
good, for a beginner.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.770
Beginner? I thought you had 
at least a little experience.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:19.160
Nope, none!

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.870
It was only four days ago when 
Kengo came begging me to help!

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:24.270
I just practiced dribbling and 
passing for all I was worth.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.350
But, what a relief!

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:29.710
I'm glad we... pulled it off...

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.210
Taiki?!

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:46.890
Man, you really saved me, Akari!

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:50.800
"Man, you really saved me," nothing!

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:53.390
Didn't I tell you to let me know

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:56.320
when you start helping out a new club?

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.030
You just have to run off and 
help anyone who's in trouble,

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:02.350
then you forget everything else and 
work yourself to exhaustion!

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.760
You've always been like that!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:08.210
But I just couldn't turn my 
back on the basketball club.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:11.390
Most of the regulars were out 
sick with food poisoning.

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.760
Kengo is switching schools next month,

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:16.700
so this is his last tournament.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.220
I'd never seen him look so sad.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:21.860
That's why...

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:23.390
Taiki...

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.670
Guess I did it again!

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:30.140
Anyway, that's all done!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.850
In that case, it's about time you 
faced off with me, Taiki Kudou.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.010
It's a duel.

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.430
Let's settle this.

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:48.440
I am called the strongest middle 
school swordsman in Koto...

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.050
Zenjirou Tsurugi!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:55.270
Um... What was that 
again... John Manjirou?

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.790
It's Zenjirou Tsurugi!

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.370
At least remember the name 
of your destined rival!

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:04.070
But I keep telling you, 
I'm just a beginner at kendo.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.120
My winning that match was just a fluke.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.860
Do you think you can get away 
with that kind of excuse?

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:14.150
If you defeated me,

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:17.550
the only explanation is that 
you must have infinite talent!

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:20.720
See? It's because you 
keep helping people

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.890
that you keep getting tangled 
up with weirdos like this.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.820
Who are you calling a weirdo?!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:29.080
Taiki has things to do with 
me tomorrow for Marine Day!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.390
He has no time to play around with you!

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:32.620
What?!

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:34.330
A duel between men

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.330
is more important than your stupid errand!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.160
Excuse me? Stupid?!

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.310
I'm dying...

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.240
What is it, Taiki?

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:48.700
I hear music...

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:49.470
Huh?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.480
I don't hear anything.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.020
Who are you?!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.360
You...

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:05.100
...can hear my voice?

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:07.200
Yes! Who are you?

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:09.570
Where are you?!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.870
What's the use in asking?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.210
I'm already a goner.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.080
And I was supposed to become the King...

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.710
The... King?

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.400
What happened?

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:40.200
How could it have gotten 
all the way up there?

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:43.730
Neither the car nor the 
building are damaged!

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.040
Help me!

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:48.610
What's going on?

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.670
Hello, is this the police?

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.520
Jump to the right!

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.700
That was close...

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:11.140
I'm impressed you saw that 
coming, Taiki Kudou.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:12.800
You really are a worthy rival.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.830
I'm glad you're okay.

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:19.970
Taiki!

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.210
There it is...

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.400
Hey, can you hear me? Hey!

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.250
You're... that kid from...

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.720
I've had it.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:48.730
I can't go on...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.760
Hey! Come on, hang in there!

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.590
What's wrong, Taiki?

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:54.600
Listen to me!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.040
The one who saved us earlier

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.240
is inside this light!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.580
What do you mean?

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.470
What are you talking about, Taiki Kudou?

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:05.780
Someone is in pain!

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:09.520
If I turn my back on him, he'll die.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.280
I can't...

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.560
...turn my back on him!

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:20.600
Taiki...

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.080
You're gonna make me cry.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.900
You softhearted fool.

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:31.490
Speak for yourself.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:35.710
Here you are on the verge 
of death, and you saved us.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:41.480
I guess we're two peas in a pod, huh?

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:43.650
Guess so.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.910
What is that?

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.850
Young boy,

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:13.020
do you wish to save the 
melody of this life?

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.530
Yes. I do.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:26.060
What is your name?

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.040
Taiki Kudou!

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:30.590
Taiki Kudou!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:31.900
Taiki Kudou!

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:33.520
Taiki Kudou!

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:34.650
Taiki Kudou!

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:40.880
Use this Xros Loader.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.050
Taiki!

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:53.930
No, no, no!

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.550
If you touch that thing, 
something bad will happen!

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.360
Yeah, just calm down!

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.530
Think this over, Taiki Kudou!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:04.390
Come on, deep breaths... 
Inhale, exhale...

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:16.580
No! He touched it!

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.060
Taiki!

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:53.510
I can call you Taiki, right?

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.290
Wake up, Taiki!

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:00.200
What are you guys doing?

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:00.900
Akari!

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.730
Ouch... What's going on?

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.760
Just a second, Taiki.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.770
I'll heal up and be right 
there to show you around!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.430
Is this...

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.830
You mean, that voice you heard before...

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.040
Yeah, it was him.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.130
That's right, Taiki!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:22.210
You saved my life when you 
put my melody in here!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:25.570
It's like I can feel some 
amazing power coming to me!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:28.590
It must be the power of the Xros 
Loader that I've heard about!

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.560
Xros Loader?

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.390
<i>Use this Xros Loader.</i>

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:36.560
What is this place?

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.330
What is that?

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:58.050
A m-m-monster!

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.350
Humans...

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.220
You are humans!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.770
The lion just talked!

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.060
<i>Crap...</i>

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.060
Taiki, don't move!

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:48.900
I will tear these humans apart!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.870
Horn Breaker!

00:14:58.860 --> 00:14:59.960
Gotcha!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:03.240
Hey! What'd ya think of that? 
Are you shaking?!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.220
M-More monsters!

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:09.150
Don't worry. They're my friends.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:12.030
Okay, Taiki, let me out now!

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:13.330
Use Reload!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.160
Like this? Reload!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.500
You pieces of garbage!

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.600
Get them! Kill them all!

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:27.670
Wanna hear it?

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:28.310
Huh?

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:30.590
You wanna hear it, don't you?

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.840
My name.

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.210
Yeah!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:38.840
I'm Shoutmon, the man who's 
gonna be King one day!

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:41.190
Be sure you remember it!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.590
Soul Crusher!

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.730
Eh?

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.220
Could it be...?

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:51.730
He's been reborn?!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:55.850
Oh, my Brother! Shoutmon is back!

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:56.900
Brother is so cool!

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:58.780
Shoutmon!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:01.310
This is a first for me, Taiki.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:04.480
Meeting a human... and 
becoming friends with one.

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:08.800
Let's go! Ballistamon, 
Starmon, Pickmons!

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.110
Right!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.080
Rowdy Rocker!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:18.420
Heavy Speaker!

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:22.530
Meteor Shower!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:34.370
Rock Damashi!

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.970
You brat!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.510
I came back to life stronger than ever!

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:42.250
Taiki gave me power!

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:46.380
I will not accept you relying 
on the help of a human!

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:55.470
What is that thing?

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:56.830
He's absorbing his own allies!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.460
Die, brat!

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:14.380
Those who oppose my army must die!

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.230
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:18.970
I won't let him be killed again 
after I finally saved his life!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:19.850
Taiki!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:20.890
I can't turn my back on him!

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:23.690
Of all the times for his 
bad habit to kick in!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:24.820
I can't believe it!

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:27.890
You fool! Stay hidden!

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.830
<i>Use the Xros Loader.</i>

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.010
DigiXros!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.310
What's that?

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:01.930
DigiXros!

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.390
Could this be...

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:18.980
...the legendary DigiXros?

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.480
Awesome, Taiki!

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:24.820
Wh-What? DigiXros?

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:38.630
Taiki! Give me one more shot of power!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.430
Shoutmon!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.280
Starmon!

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.530
Pickmons!

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:45.740
DigiXros!

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:57.620
Star Blade!

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.270
We did it!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.970
I'll get you for this!

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:28.050
Wait, please, Lord Tactimon!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.680
I can still fight!

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:32.220
I can...

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:37.830
Next time I'll kill those brats, 
and the humans!

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:46.630
To think that MadLeomon would 
besmirch my battle record.

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:48.670
Laughable.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:56.620
Save the laughing for after you see 
our next strategy in action.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.130
The Green Zone will be ours...

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.500
Perfectly.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:04.150
I've fallen for you, Taiki!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.680
No doubt about it!

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:08.340
You are the legendary hero, the General!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:09.320
General?

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.460
Sort of a commander who

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.460
gives us more power by 
letting us DigiXros.

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.590
At any rate, you're our savior!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:21.310
Please, lead me on the path 
to becoming the Digimon King!

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:23.470
Digimon? What's that?

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.680
You don't know...

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.770
that this is the Digital World?

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:34.440
What's the Digital World?

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:36.890
Glance.

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:38.250
That is a glance, all right.

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:42.030
We can't underestimate 
this one, Miss Nene.

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:46.590
That would make things interesting.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:52.260
They're coming again.

00:20:58.050 --> 00:20:59.570
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.840
<b>Monitamon's Lovely♥ Enemy Search</b>

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.940
Searching for enemy data.

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:03.370
Shoutmon.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:05.200
Attacks include Soul Crusher,

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:14.520
<b>[Type]

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:14.520
<b>Mini Dragon Type</b>

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:14.520
<b>Rock Damashi

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:07.470
which blasts opponents with 
a shout from his soul.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:08.710
I'll try it, too.

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:11.400
I'm hungry! Give me something to eat!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.100
You call that a "shout from your soul"?!

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.020
What's the Digital World?

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:19.390
Also, we've gotta get 
back to our own world!

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:20.420
What did you say?!

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.630
But MadLeomon is attacking again!

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.630
What should we do?!

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:26.360
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:28.020
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.380
<b>Shoutmon Roars!</b>
